      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SAKO (8) missed the frame two back but wound up strongly last time, finishing on late when second (35.63) in a Grade 5 at this track. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of three starts. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Makes plenty of appeal. ZIPPING EVANIA (1) has a strong overall record having 15 wins and 34 places from 69 starts including a last start third (36.16) over 622m at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. RAYMAR SHAME (5) lines up here off a comfortable win at this track after jumping from box 4 (35.44). Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Likely to be in the finish. ANCIENT EGYPTIAN (4) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
